# Witness: a table cell carrying a mark the legend does not publish

`[APPROVED]` has eight characters inside the brackets. The first attempt capped the inner text
at six, so `[APPROVED]`, `[REJECTED]`, `[NOT MET]` and `[PENDING]` all escaped the rule -
precisely the tokens an author reaches for.

| ID | Area | Verdict |
|---|---|---|
| RA-1 | Bounded reading of untrusted bytes | `[APPROVED]` |
